# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# Explicit pass-throughs for the /yoga/ section so Cloudflare
# serves the correct index.html for each subdirectory.
# Trailing /* ensures assets (CSS, JS, images) resolve correctly too.

/yoga              /yoga/index.html  200
/yoga/live         /yoga/live/index.html  200
/yoga/about        /yoga/about/index.html  200
/yoga/recorded     /yoga/recorded/index.html  200
